                                                "text": "Near-synonym: bank paper"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a884bde-832f-427b-b68d-7480b91eeff1",
                                                "sense_id": "572a8ff1-1726-319c-a52b-097e6862435a",
                                                "text": "Was Captain Macheath here this Morning, for the Bank-notes he left with you last Week?"
                                            }
